msgstr "没人要六分仪的话，我包里还能装下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_21.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_21.1"
msgid "I don't know what a toy boat is worth here. I could ask."
msgstr "不知道玩具船在这儿值多少。我可以去问问。"

