msgid "I don't know what a broken aac device is worth here. I could ask."
msgstr "不知道损坏的沟通辅助装置在这儿值多少。我可以去问问。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_23.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_23.2"
