msgid "Try a strip of jungle turf by the door. See how it looks."
msgstr "门口铺一条丛林地皮试试，看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_JUNGLE.2
